# Generated event-cache data files — large, machine-built from RPC, not
# hand-edited. `linguist-generated` collapses them by default in the GitHub PR
# file list and excludes them from language stats, so reviewers aren't drowned
# in ~200k lines of generated JSON. The textual diff stays available ("Load
# diff" on GitHub; `git diff`/`git log -p` locally) so a targeted change is
# still auditable — we intentionally do NOT set `-diff`. Integrity is enforced
# by the deterministic build + `validate-events`; never hand-edit these files.
public/proposals-events-data.json linguist-generated
public/votes-events-data.json linguist-generated
